<!-- Handoff about.html: year. Native Astro markup; shared document shell is V9Layout. -->
<section class="g-dark" id="year">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow" data-v9-reveal><span class="tick">\</span> What we did about it</div>
    <h2 style="--d:60ms" data-v9-reveal>We spent a year not launching.</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="--d:120ms" data-v9-reveal>
      We were testing whether a stranger’s judgment could be trusted with someone’s career. You can’t learn that in
      public, on real candidates.
    </p>
    <div class="ab-tl" id="abTl">
      <span class="ab-tl-rule" aria-hidden="true"><i class="ab-tl-cell"></i></span>
      <ol>
        <li style="--d:0ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <span class="ab-tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pf-k">2024</span><h3>The coffee</h3><p>
            Two hours, one table, and a problem neither of us could name properly. We called it the connection gap
            because nothing better came to mind. The coffee went cold.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li style="--d:80ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <span class="ab-tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pf-k">Soon after</span><h3>
            The commitment
          </h3><p>Pranav joined. All three of us walked away from what we were doing. Nobody does that for a maybe.</p>
        </li>
        <li style="--d:160ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <span class="ab-tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pf-k">Jun 2024 – May 2025</span><h3>
            The lab
          </h3><p>
            <b class="ab-big" data-count="200000">200,000</b> interviews read, scored and argued about. Twelve months building
            something nobody outside the three of us could use.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li style="--d:240ms" data-v9-reveal>
          <span class="ab-tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pf-k">2025 onward</span><h3>Three names</h3><p>
            Our first client signed in 2025. Every search since has run the same way: three names, all hireable, and the
            reasoning behind each rank.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
    <p class="decide decide--d" data-v9-reveal><b>Everyone else was shipping. We were still reading.</b></p>
  </div>
</section>
